{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"“Fano 簇”"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"Fano簇"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"典范丛","text":"典范丛"}},{"Plain":"的逆 $\\omega_X^{-1}$ 是丰沛层.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"射影空间","text":"射影空间"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathbb P^N$ 是 Fano 簇.</li>\n<li>设 $D$ 是 $\\mathbb P^N$ 的余一维子簇, 由伴随公式 $K_D = (K_X +D )\\big|_D=(-(N+1)H+\\deg(D) H)\\big|_D$ ($H$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"超平面类","text":"超平面丛"}},{"Plain":"), 当 $\\deg(D) \\leq n$ 时, $D$ 是 Fano 簇.</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}